[N 23-24 Darkshore]
[D Forever Alliance 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Prep in Stormwind, the boat to Auberdine, a side trip to Darnassus for the Blackfathom quests, then one long Darkshore loop (the tower, Gyromast, Onu's Grove, the Master's Glaive, Murkdeep, the Stormscale coast) and the Kerlonian escort into Ashenvale.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 23|r  -  you are in Stormwind fresh from Redridge; hearth = Sentinel Hill (leave it there). Darkshore is one dead-end coast: Auberdine in the middle, the Cliffspring/tower/Gyromast corner in the north, Onu's Grove and the road into Ashenvale in the south. The core lines are about 28,800 quest XP (about 24,000 after level decay) and the optional lines add up to 15,700 more; nearly every quest is level 17-22, so it pays 80-100% at your level.
[OC]|cffffcc00The loop:|r Auberdine pickups > south-east camp (1 objective) > north-east (mushrooms, waterfall, tower, Gyromast) > south (Onu, Murkdeep, the Glaive, Remtravel) > Auberdine hand-ins > north again (ritual camp, elites, Stormscale coast) > Auberdine > south and out with Kerlonian. Auberdine is on the way every time, so hand in there as you pass.

[OC]|cffffffffStormwind|r
[O][A Hunter] At [TAR5510 Thulman Flintcrag] buy ammo for the whole chapter (600 Heavy Shot for a gun; arrows if you carry a bow) [G61.9,36.6 Stormwind City]
[O][A Shaman] Deeprun Tram to Ironforge to train level 22: Darnassus has no shaman trainer, and level 24 waits for the next Ironforge visit [G73.8,49.2 Stormwind City]
[O][A Shaman] In the Forlorn Cavern at [TAR258098 Eldrun Stormbreaker], [T] train your level 22 spells [G46.2,13.2 Ironforge]
[O][A Shaman] Tram back to Stormwind [G76.5,51.5 Ironforge]
[O]At [TAR7232 Borgus Steelhand], [QA97894 Business in Auberdine] (XP not listed; a breadcrumb to Gorbold on the Auberdine dock that leads into Deep Ocean, Vast Sea) [G59.4,34.3 Stormwind City]
[OC]Stock food and water, repair, empty the bags. The Auberdine boat leaves from the northern pier of the harbor (the sign names the destination)
Walk down to the harbor pier [G24.5,4 Stormwind City]

[OC]|cffffffffAuberdine, then Darnassus|r
Ride the boat to Auberdine. At flight master [TAR3841 Caylais Moonfeather], get the [P Auberdine] flight path (you fly back to it from Teldrassil) [G36.3,45.6 Darkshore]
[OC]Take the Rut'theran Village boat from the Auberdine piers (read the signs), about 5 minutes
Board the boat to Rut'theran Village [G38.3,43 Darkshore]
At [TAR3838 Vesprystus] in Rut'theran Village, get the [P Rut'theran Village] flight path [G58.4,94 Teldrassil]
[OC]Walk into the portal inside the village: it leads up to Darnassus
At [TAR4786 Dawnwatcher Shaedlass], [QA1198 In Search of Thaelrid] (Argent Guard Thaelrid waits inside Blackfathom Deeps - chapter 13) [G55.4,25 Darnassus]
At [TAR4784 Argent Guard Manados], [QA1199 Twilight Falls] (10 Twilight Pendants from the Twilight elites inside Blackfathom - chapter 13) [G55.2,24 Darnassus]
[O][A Hunter] At [TAR4146 Jocaste], [T] train your level 22 spells (24 too if you are already there) [G40.4,8.6 Darnassus]
[OC]Chief Archaeologist Greywhisker (31.2,84.5 here) is where the Absent Minded Prospector chain ends later (chapter 20) - do not look for him now
Back through the portal; at [TAR3838 Vesprystus] |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Auberdine]|r [G58.4,94 Teldrassil]

