[O]If a Book: The Powers Below drops from the same Disciples/Thugs, right-click it [QA968 The Powers Below] (rare; goes to Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge, chapter 15 - do not farm it) [G38.5,86.5 Darkshore]
